# Changelog (automatic on merge)

`CHANGELOG.md` is one line per merged PR, newest first. GitHub Action
`.github/workflows/changelog.yml` appends the line when the PR lands on
`master`. Do not hand-edit dated entries for work that will merge.

## PR title is the log line

Write a short title that says what was fixed (the operator-facing change).
That title becomes `- Title ([#N](…))` under today's date.

## Skip

Put `[skip changelog]` in the title for noise (typo-only, revert of a
revert, changelog-tooling with nothing to report).
